[0.0.4]
* Fix: disable PKCE in the Cloudron OIDC single sign-on configuration; Cloudron's OIDC authorization endpoint rejected the request with "invalid_request" when PKCE was enabled alongside a public client (no client_secret transmitted)

[0.0.3]
* Add Cloudron Single Sign-On support via the oidc addon ("Login with Cloudron" using Zammad's generic OpenID Connect provider). Requires a fresh install to take effect.

[0.0.2]
* Fix: PostgreSQL database creation (POSTGRESQL_DB_CREATE=false) to match Cloudron's PostgreSQL addon, which pre-creates the app database and restricts access to it

[0.0.1]
* Initial release
